  m_text: "<color=#AAD595><size=34><b>Team</b></size></color>\n\
    <b>Gilianne Patani</b>\n\
    \n\
    <color=#AAD595><size=34><b>Characters and animation</b></size></color>\n\
    Microsoft Rocketbox by Microsoft (MIT)\n\
    Medical Male 03 and Medical Female 02 for Dr. Edward Grey and the lab assistant. The Shapeweld VRM models were converted to FBX.\n\
    Yaku J Ignite, Zombiegirl W Kurniawan, Pumpkinhulk L Shaw, and the Zombie Idle, Zombie Scratch Idle, and Zombie Scream animations from Adobe Mixamo.\n\
    Spider Monster by konared (TurboSquid Standard License, asset 1505616)\n\
    \n\
    <color=#AAD595><size=34><b>Environments and props</b></size></color>\n\
    Science Laboratory and Cleanroom by 3DAssets.dev (CC0 1.0)\n\
    The AI-generated bench drawers, freezer, microscope, and biosafety cabinet were converted to FBX and fitted to Genesis Lab.\n\
    Concrete 034 by ambientCG (CC0 1.0)\n\
    Mines and Cave Modular Set by Loafbrr (CC0 1.0)\n\
    Russian buildings pack by MadMedicSoft\n\
    Brick House by Aerolife\n\
    Realistic Tree 9 [Rainbow Tree] by Pixel Games\n\
    Rocks FREE pack by DEXSOFT\n\
    Alps Field by Andreas Mischok, Poly Haven (CC0 1.0)\n\
    MudRockyAlbedoSpecular from Unity Standard Assets\n\
    Pirate Coin by DavePixel (CC BY 4.0 per the bundled readme)\n\
    The gold variant was integrated into the ZombieBusters pickup prefab.\n\
    https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/props/pirate-coin-207743\n\
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\n\
    \n\
    <color=#AAD595><size=34><b>Controller, interface and artwork</b></size></color>\n\
    Mini First Person Controller by Simi Canari\n\
    TextMesh Pro by Unity\n\
    EmojiOne sprite sheet by EmojiOne (https://www.emojione.com/)\n\
    Liberation Sans by Google Corporation and Red Hat, Inc. (SIL OFL 1.1)\n\
    Roboto Bold by Google (Apache License 2.0)\n\
    PTF Nordic Rnd by prismtone\n\
    Anton, Bangers, and Oswald Bold by Vernon Adams (SIL OFL 1.1)\n\
    Electronic Highway Sign by Ash Pikachu Font\n\
    Menu, mechanics, cutscene, and result artwork made with Canva.\n\
    \n\
    <color=#AAD595><size=34><b>License notices</b></size></color>\n\
    Microsoft Rocketbox\n\
